===Comfort the Knights of Beauty's "sidekick"{{subst:void|<!--200080206-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Parlor Car|update|A spaceship... has somehow rear-ended the Astral Express!?<br />You decide to go and encourage the IPC staff member whose attitude is wildly different from the Knight of Beauty and who looks just like another minor character... These two don't seem like they'd get along! Why are they appearing together?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Argenti)
:'''Argenti:''' (Trailblazer), may I help you? I am currently enjoying the present moment.

;(Talk to Velite)
----
:'''Velite:''' What is it? Here to cheer me up? Save your breath! Your intentions might as well be written on your forehead.
:'''Velite:''' I'm just a small-time IPC worker &mdash; that Argenti rescued me. I don't know anything... and I can't help you guys.
:'''Velite:''' *sigh* I want to go home and have dinner... once we're out of this jam...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I heard you became a follower of Aeon of Beauty. Is that true?
:'''Velite:''' Did Argenti tell you that?
:'''Velite:''' That guy is unbelievable. Before he rescued me, he said something like: "You must pledge to acknowledge Idrila, the Beauty, as the most peerless beauty of all!"
:'''Velite:''' I told him I'd marry her if he liked, as long as he got me out of that stinking cave first... And he refused! I couldn't believe it!
:'''Velite:''' My life was on the line, so I just repeated after him: Adrila the Beauty, et cetera... You get the picture.
:'''Velite:''' Then, he corrected me, "It's Idrila, not Adrila."
:'''Velite:''' Who came up with such an awkward-sounding name? I'm a pencil pusher, what the heck do I know about the Aeon of Beauty?
:'''Velite:''' But, of course, I repeated it again in order to survive.
:'''Velite:''' "Idrila, the Beauty, is the most peerless beauty of them all!"
:'''Velite:''' Just like that.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can't you be more positive?
:'''Velite:''' Tsk, do you think I like being negative? My friend, this is what's known as falling prey to the grim reality of life, understand?
:'''Velite:''' When I was young, I assumed my life would be like a novel. I wanted to be a pilot, flying through outer space, exploring the universe in a grand spaceship. But then my parents told me I'd have to work for the IPC and make a bunch of money to fulfill my dreams.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you manage to make a bunch of money in the end?
::'''Velite:''' What do you think? Do rich people make forced vows in caves?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Does working for the IPC stop you from pursuing your dreams?
::'''Velite:''' Enough! This is a painful topic...
:'''Velite:''' I gave up my unrealistic dream of becoming a pilot and worked for the IPC instead. I guess I'm living the life of a supporting character now.
:'''Velite:''' But after running into Argenti, I had an idea... Perhaps I could make some money with him and turn my life around!
:'''Velite:''' He's a tall, handsome, and a knight! Packaged and marketed the right way, I'm sure he'll pique a lot of interest!
:'''Velite:''' I told him about my idea &mdash; that he could advocate for "the Beauty" while also incorporating currency as a notion of beauty. That would allow him to preach more efficiently. He was very impressed.
:'''Velite:''' I'm planning to contact the Marketing Development Department as soon as I'm off the Express &mdash; he'll make a great IPC product spokesperson! And I can be his agent! Now, the question remains &mdash; will this guy shine brighter as an image-focused idol, or should we showcase his formidable talents and mold him into a powerful star?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} An idol.
::'''Velite:''' You're right. It'd be a shame to waste such a handsome face. He just screams "idol!"
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A powerful star.
::'''Velite:''' You're right. I don't know what his rank among the knights is, but he is quite powerful.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you talking about?
::'''Velite:''' Hmph, it's called facing reality, embracing it, and then conquering it!
:'''Velite:''' So, when can I get off the Express? I need you guys to solve this traffic jam problem ASAP!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's enough of your weird ideas. Come help us.
::'''Velite:''' Were you even listening to me?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Come help us... Pretty please?
::'''Velite:''' Don't use that tone! You're trying to guilt-trip me, aren't you?
:'''Velite:''' *sigh* Alright, I have nowhere else to be. Let's go.
